msgid ""
"Approximate EQ response. Drag band nodes horizontally to adjust frequency; drag vertically to "
"adjust gain for peaking and shelf filters. Scroll over a node to adjust Q."
msgstr "等化器近似響應。水平拖曳頻段節點以調整頻率；峰值與棚架濾波器也可透過垂直拖曳調整增益。將游標移至節點上並捲動滾輪可調整 Q 值。"

msgid ""
"Approximate low-pass response. The cutoff node stays on the 0 dB reference line. Drag "
"horizontally to adjust cutoff, vertically to adjust resonance relative to its starting value "
"(12/18/24 dB)."
msgstr "近似低通響應。截止節點保持在 0 dB 參考線上，水平拖曳調整截止頻率，垂直拖曳調整相對起始值的共振（12/18/24 dB）"

